## Definitions

**"Software"** means the Fortress source code, binaries, documentation, and
associated materials made available under this license.

**"Commercial Distribution"** means selling, licensing, or distributing
the Software, or a modified version of it, as part of a commercial software
product or service offered to third parties.

**"Managed Service"** means making the Software's functionality available
to third parties as a hosted or managed offering, whether or not a fee is
charged.

## Permitted Uses

Permission is granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of
this Software to:

1. Use, copy, and modify the Software for any purpose — including
